---
import CaseStudyLayout from '../../layouts/CaseStudyLayout.astro';
---

<CaseStudyLayout
  title="Academic Data Automation"
  subtitle="Automation for extracting, normalizing and consolidating academic information from a closed legacy web system without API or database access."
  eyebrow="Confidential Project · Case Study"
  stack={['Python', 'Playwright', 'BeautifulSoup', 'Pandas', 'Excel', 'Oracle APEX']}
  confidential={true}
>
  <div class="case-grid">
    <article class="case-panel">
      <h2>Constraint</h2>
      <p>
        The source system offered neither API nor database access. Staff otherwise had to navigate
        career by career and student by student to build a consolidated roster.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="case-panel">
      <h2>Automation</h2>
      <p>
        The workflow uses authenticated browser automation, custom pagination handling,
        session reuse, throttling and direct HTML parsing to gather and normalize records.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="case-panel">
      <h2>Reliability</h2>
      <p>
        Incremental CSV/XLSX persistence, error logs and saved debug HTML reduce the cost of
        long-running failures and make the extraction process recoverable and auditable.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</CaseStudyLayout>
